<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <p>
      tuṟai: centuṟaip pāṭāṇpāṭṭu, vaṇṇam: atu, tūkku: atu.
    </p>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Pati7.62">
        <l>iḻaiyaṇin teḻutarum palkaḷiṟṟut toḻutiyoṭu </l>
        <l>maḻaiyeṉa maruḷu māyirum paḵṟō</l>
        <l>leḵkupaṭai yaṟutta koycuvaṟ puraviyoṭu</l>
        <l>maintuṭai yāreyil puṭaipaṭa vaḷaii</l>
        <l>vantupuṟat tiṟukkum pacumpici roḷḷaḻaṉ</l>
        <l>ñāyiṟu palkiya māyamoṭu cuṭartikaḻ</l>
        <l>pollā mayaloṭu pāṭimiḻ peḻutaru </l>
        <l>maṭaṅkal vaṇṇaṅ koṇṭa kaṭuntiṟaṟ</l>
        <l>ṟupputtuṟai pōkiya koṟṟa vēntē</l>
        <l>puṉalporu kiṭaṅkiṉ <hi rend="bold">varaipō liñci</hi></l>
        <l>yaṇaṅkuṭait taṭakkaiyar tōṭṭi ceppip </l>
        <l>paṇintutiṟai pakarpaniṉ pakaiva rāyiṟ</l>
        <l>pulluṭai viyaṉpulam pallā parappi</l>
        <l>vaḷaṉuṭaic ceṟuviṉ viḷaintavai yutirnta</l>
        <l>kaḷaṉaṟu kuppai kāñcic cērtti</l>
        <l>yariya lārkai vaṉkai viṉaina</l>
        <l>raruvi yāmpaṉ malainta ceṉṉiya</l>
        <l>rāṭuciṟai varivaṇ ṭōppum</l>
        <l>pāṭal cāṉṟavava rakaṉṟalai nāṭē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l/>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>

